1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,367
Get out.

2
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:03,400
Get out!

3
00:00:03,733 --> 00:00:05,267
I'm on a hot surface!

4
00:00:05,267 --> 00:00:06,233
[CAR DOOR OPENS]

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,467
Are you crazy?

6
00:00:08,467 --> 00:00:09,433
[CAR DOOR CLOSES]

7
00:00:09,433 --> 00:00:10,467
Yes.

8
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:13,233
Living a hard life
makes me crazy.

9
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:16,200
Let's stop fighting!

10
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:17,733
I have a proposal.

11
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:21,233
Be my Papa Ping.

12
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:24,033
We'll share the inheritance.

13
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:25,633
Right?
That's a win-win situation.

14
00:00:25,633 --> 00:00:29,600
[PLAYFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

15
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:30,633
Come on.

16
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:33,267
[SMACK]

17
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,667
[BLOWS]

18
00:00:36,233 --> 00:00:37,367
[SILLY SFX PLAYING]

19
00:00:39,367 --> 00:00:41,267
- [GLASS BREAKS SFX PLAYING]
- Agh! Ouch!

20
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,633
- [STOMPING]
- Ouch! My heart!

21
00:00:44,033 --> 00:00:45,233
Hey, chill out!

22
00:00:45,233 --> 00:00:46,700
Think about it.

23
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:48,767
Give me a month.

24
00:00:49,767 --> 00:00:50,733
Just a month.

25
00:00:51,133 --> 00:00:52,133
A month.

26
00:00:52,533 --> 00:00:54,167
You'll be a nuisance
for a month.

27
00:00:54,167 --> 00:00:55,700
I've got tons to do
in the mansion.

28
00:00:56,133 --> 00:00:57,567
I'm not going to bother you.

29
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:00,600
And when the month is over,
and you still don't want me,

30
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,700
fine, whatever.

31
00:01:02,233 --> 00:01:03,233
What now?

32
00:01:04,067 --> 00:01:05,067
Come on.

33
00:01:05,633 --> 00:01:06,933
[ZIA] Uh...

34
00:01:06,933 --> 00:01:09,067
this could be the answer to
your problem with your brother.

35
00:01:14,367 --> 00:01:17,567
Our firm is building
an estafa case against Toto.

36
00:01:18,067 --> 00:01:19,800
And the share offered by June

37
00:01:20,267 --> 00:01:21,167
will be more than enough

38
00:01:21,167 --> 00:01:23,733
to make up
for Pindang Tocino's loss.

39
00:01:26,833 --> 00:01:28,633
I can't trust her, Attorney.

40
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:31,067
Just because
your brother deceived you

41
00:01:31,067 --> 00:01:33,800
doesn't mean
everyone will do so.

42
00:01:34,733 --> 00:01:36,333
I know it's hard to trust again.

43
00:01:36,333 --> 00:01:38,300
But... try.

44
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,200
[PING]
<i> My brother will never learn</i>

45
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,600
<i>if I just keep saving him
over and over.</i>

46
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:47,467
<i>I can't just spend the money
I didn't work hard for.</i>

47
00:01:49,667 --> 00:01:51,100
Is there no other way?

48
00:01:52,533 --> 00:01:55,367
Unless she's not related
by blood, which she is.

49
00:01:55,367 --> 00:01:56,333
We checked.

50
00:01:56,533 --> 00:01:58,267
All her records are clean.

51
00:02:00,433 --> 00:02:02,400
[PING]<i> And all the inheritance
</i> would just go to this scammer?

52
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:03,833
<i> I won't make it easy for you.</i>

53
00:02:04,367 --> 00:02:05,667
<i> Watch your back.</i>

54
00:02:06,733 --> 00:02:07,767
Okay.

55
00:02:07,767 --> 00:02:08,733
Fine!

56
00:02:10,467 --> 00:02:11,400
One month.

57
00:02:12,433 --> 00:02:13,633
[TAPS] There we go!

58
00:02:14,867 --> 00:02:16,233
[SCOFFS]

59
00:02:16,233 --> 00:02:18,233
To think you were acting
all shy earlier. [TONGUE CLICKS]

60
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,667
See? You didn't have
to make a fuss.

61
00:02:21,467 --> 00:02:26,200
I'll make sure you fall in love
with me within a month.

62
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:31,867
I'll also find proof that
you're not related to Don Nato.

63
00:02:32,633 --> 00:02:38,400
[ELECTRICITY CRACKLING
SFX PLAYING]

64
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:43,533
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]
